face-image: img/events/foot.jpg

= Bournemouth

At Labour's conference in Bournemouth, Neil Kinnock turns on Militant and its Liverpool council, which has set an illegal budget and handed out redundancy notices to its own workers to make a point. Derek Hatton heckles from the floor; Eric Heffer walks off the platform. The rest of the hall gives Kinnock a standing ovation. Labour has started to look like a party that wants to win.

@riots_1985
title: The Riots Return
tags: event
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and second_term = 1 and riots_1985_seen = 0 and time >= 93 and unemployment >= 9
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
