face-image: img/events/foot.jpg

= Labour's Campaign

Labour has a new symbol, a red rose, and a campaign that looks better than ours. Its first broadcast is a film about Kinnock and his wife Glenys, made by the director of Chariots of Fire, and Kinnock's own ratings jump overnight. A rogue poll shows our lead collapsing, and there is panic at Central Office.

- @more_ads: Spend whatever it takes on advertising.
- @hold_nerve: Hold your nerve.

@more_ads
subtitle: -1 resource. The panic subsides.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 1 resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; c1_con += 1*(1-dissent); c2_con += 1*(1-dissent)

The agencies are told to take every page they can get. The last week of the campaign is ours.

@hold_nerve
on-arrival: loyalist_dissent -= 1

The polls settle. Most of them never showed what the rogue poll showed.
